WEBVTT

00:00:28.964 --> 00:00:31.271
ici faire Des choses on peut manger.

00:00:31.737 --> 00:00:35.269
(French) Mais quand
tu es fâché avec quelqu'un

00:00:35.293 --> 00:00:37.161
c'est pas passé the first time.

00:00:37.185 --> 00:00:40.454
(British English) And that's one
of the things that I enjoy most

00:00:40.478 --> 00:00:43.185
about this convention.

00:00:43.963 --> 00:00:50.531
It's not so much, as so little
has to do with what everything is.

00:00:51.028 --> 00:00:52.707
(Laughter)

00:00:54.728 --> 00:00:56.838
But it is within our self-interest

00:00:56.862 --> 00:00:59.792
to understand the topography of our lives

00:00:59.816 --> 00:01:01.210
unto ourselves.